"Trusted LAN policy is enabled, but the runtime is still listening on loopback only. LAN devices cannot connect until the listener is explicitly bound to a LAN-capable address." = "已启用可信局域网策略，但当前运行环境仍只监听本机回环地址。只有显式将监听地址绑定到可供局域网访问的地址后，其他局域网设备才能连接。";
"A custom console path only reduces opportunistic scanning; it never replaces authentication. Trusted LAN CIDRs are a network admission gate only. Allowed LAN devices must still sign in with a Passkey or password fallback, and public access remains HTTPS + authentication." = "自定义控制台入口路径只用于降低自动扫描与探测噪音，不能替代身份认证。可信局域网 CIDR 也只负责网络准入；允许的局域网设备仍必须使用通用密钥或密码备用方式登录，公网访问仍必须使用 HTTPS 与身份认证。";
"Access policy updated and running services restarted." = "访问策略已更新，正在运行的服务已重启并应用新策略。";
"Access policy updated. Stopped services remain stopped." = "访问策略已更新；当前已停止的服务保持停止。";
"Access policy could not be updated. Check the console path and LAN CIDR values." = "无法更新访问策略，请检查控制台入口路径与局域网 CIDR。";
"Apply Access Policy and Restart Services?" = "应用访问策略并重启服务？";
"The new console path and network admission policy take effect after the Control Plane restarts. Running ChatCockpit services will restart now; stopped services are never started automatically." = "新的控制台入口路径与网络准入策略需要在控制平面重启后生效。当前正在运行的 ChatCockpit 服务将立即重启；已停止的服务绝不会被自动启动。";
"Apply and Restart" = "应用并重启";
"Local passwordless sign-in was unavailable, so ChatCockpit opened the normal local sign-in page instead." = "本机免密登录暂时不可用，ChatCockpit 已改为打开普通本机登录页。";
"Opening Local Cockpit from this App uses a single-use loopback login grant when the console administrator is configured. The grant expires quickly, is never persisted in browser storage, and does not weaken public authentication." = "已配置控制台管理员时，从此 App 打开本机控制台会使用一次性回环登录凭据。该凭据会快速过期，不会写入浏览器持久存储，也不会降低公网访问的认证强度。";
